*> Implementation test (T2426; docs/protocol/20 section 3.2): effective (local) difficulty and the special multiplier. Values are in thousandths.
*> eff = difficulty id x (base + b), base = 0.75 + 0.25 x clamp((T - 72000) / 1440000), b = clamp(I / 3600000) x (1 Hard else 0.75) + clamp(M x 0.25, 0, a),
*> halved on Easy; Peaceful 0. Special multiplier: 0 below 2, 1 above 4, else (eff - 2) / 2.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-MOB-20-3-2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-DIFF                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TIME                BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-INHABITED           BINARY-DOUBLE.
 01 WS-MOON                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-EFF                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MULT                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: Peaceful is 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-DIFF
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: Normal, new world, new chunk is 1.5" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1500 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 3 TO WS-DIFF
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: Hard, new world is 2.25" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2250 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1512000 TO WS-TIME
     MOVE 3600000 TO WS-INHABITED
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: Hard, oldest world, full chunk is 6" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 6000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-DIFF
     MOVE 0 TO WS-TIME
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: Easy, full chunk, new world is 1.125" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1125 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 3 TO WS-DIFF
     MOVE 1512000 TO WS-TIME
     MOVE 0 TO WS-INHABITED
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-MOON
     CALL "STDMOB-DIFFICULTY" USING WS-DIFF WS-TIME WS-INHABITED WS-MOON WS-EFF
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: the moon adds at most a (Hard, full moon, old world is 3.75)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3750 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-EFF TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-EFF
     CALL "STDMOB-SPECIAL" USING WS-EFF WS-MULT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: special multiplier below 2 is 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-MULT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 3000 TO WS-EFF
     CALL "STDMOB-SPECIAL" USING WS-EFF WS-MULT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: special multiplier at 3 is 0.5" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 500 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-MULT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 4500 TO WS-EFF
     CALL "STDMOB-SPECIAL" USING WS-EFF WS-MULT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§3.2 Effective: special multiplier above 4 is 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-MULT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM TEST-MOB-20-3-2.
